 diag/prepare_stage_panics.py | 98 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 include/linux/diag_stage.h   | 50 +++++++++++++-----
 init/main.c                  | 14 ++----
 3 files changed, 122 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)

